flowchart TD
  H[Authenticated HELLO] --> A{Authority generation/epoch valid?}
  A -- no, stale --> S[REJECT_STALE and fence]
  A -- future unproven --> S
  A -- yes --> T{Exact topology fingerprint?}
  T -- no --> C{Supported full-model reconfiguration?}
  C -- yes --> RC[RECONFIGURE: new generation + rebuild/convert]
  C -- no --> RS[RESET_SESSION]
  T -- yes --> M{Same committed rank manifest present and verified?}
  M -- yes --> E[RESUME_EXACT after two-rank attach barrier]
  M -- no --> I[Compare Merkle subtrees / bounded inventory]
  I --> P{Missing pages available independently?}
  P -- yes --> D[FETCH_DELTA only for missing/corrupt objects]
  P -- no --> R{Compact replay state and complete executable topology?}
  R -- yes --> B[REBUILD_RANK by force-replay]
  R -- no --> RS
  D --> V[Verify all objects and logical position]
  B --> V
  V --> E
